<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia November producer prices up 0.4 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Slovenia November producer prices up 0.4 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIA PRODUCER PRICES	 Nov	Oct     Nov95</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)	    +0.4     +1.2     +1.2</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)		+5.9     +6.7     +8.2</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
